---
title: GitHub CI Workflows
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant FB as Feature Branch
    participant M as master

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over FB,M: PR → master (pr-checks.yml)
        Dev->>FB: push changes
        FB->>M: open PR
        activate M
        M->>M: composer lint (phpcs)
        M->>M: composer test (phpunit)
        M->>M: pnpm lint:js
        M->>M: pnpm test (Vitest)
        M->>M: pnpm typecheck
        M->>M: pnpm license:verify
        M->>M: pnpm i18n:make-pot (validate extraction, no commit)
        deactivate M
        M-->>FB: checks pass
        Dev->>M: merge PR
    end

    rect rgb(224, 255, 230)
        Note over M: Push → master, post-merge (merge-checks.yml)
        activate M
        M->>M: composer lint (phpcs)
        M->>M: composer test (phpunit)
        M->>M: pnpm lint:js
        M->>M: pnpm test (Vitest)
        M->>M: pnpm typecheck
        M->>M: pnpm license:verify
        M->>M: pnpm i18n:make-pot → commit .pot to master (WP-CLI, EndBug/add-and-commit)
        M->>M: pnpm test:e2e (Playwright + WP Playground)
        deactivate M
    end
